": "她很烦人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8093.27, "timestamp": "02:14:53", "text": "小菜一碟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8095.03, "timestamp": "02:14:55", "text": "对了，R，把代码给我。该死的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8096.069, "timestamp": "02:14:56", "text": "。 如果你想玩，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8097.75, "timestamp": "02:14:57", "text": "你的意思是你已经进入游戏了吗？ 我们知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8099.669, "timestamp": "02:14:59", "text": "你参与其中，兄弟。 我没有那段"}]